<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Soft Skills en la era de la IA · Por qué el mercado laboral las exige</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root {
    --accent: #c8795a;
    --accent-2: #e8b86d;
    --accent-3: #7c9a8e;
    --accent-4: #a67c9d;
    --text: #f0e9e0;
    --muted: #b8a99a;
    --bg-deep: #1a1410;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    height: 100%;
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, #2d2119 0%, #1a1410 55%, #100c09 100%);
    color: var(--text);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(200,121,90,0.12), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 90%, rgba(232,184,109,0.10), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 55% 65%, rgba(124,154,142,0.08), transparent 40%);
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: floatBg 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes floatBg {
    0%   { transform: scale(1) translate(0,0); }
    100% { transform: scale(1.08) translate(-1%, -1%); }
  }

  .deck {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .slide {
    position: absolute;
    width: min(1080px, 94vw);
    max-height: 90vh;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(45,33,25,0.96), rgba(26,20,16,0.96));
    border-radius: 2rem;
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.7),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(200,121,90,0.22),
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    padding: 2.2rem 2.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.97);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
    overflow-y: auto;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .slide.active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    pointer-events: auto;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .slide::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
  .slide::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(200,121,90,0.4); border-radius: 8px; }

  .slide-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.3);
    animation: fadeDown 0.6s ease both;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .slide-title i {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    background: rgba(232,184,109,0.10);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    animation: pop 0.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1.4) both;
  }

  @keyframes pop {
    0%   { transform: scale(0) rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0; }
    100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0); opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes fadeDown {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-12px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .slide p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #e0d4c5;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
  }

  .slide strong { color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 600; }

  .quote {
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.10);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ede1d3;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .quote::before { content: "“"; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--accent-2); line-height: 0; vertical-align: -0.4rem; margin-right: 0.2rem; }
  .quote::after  { content: "”"; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--accent-2); line-height: 0; vertical-align: -0.4rem; margin-left: 0.2rem; }

  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0;
  }

  .stat {
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.25);
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    text-align: center;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
  }

  .stat:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .stat:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .stat:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }

  .stat .num {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .stat .label {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .stat .source {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--accent-3);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.22);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
  }

  .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.08s; }
  .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.16s; }
  .card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.24s; }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.08);
  }

  .card .ico {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .card strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .card span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
  }

  .list { list-style: none; margin: 0.5rem 0; }

  .list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(200,121,90,0.15);
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    color: #e0d4c5;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .list li i {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .list li strong { color: var(--accent-2); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }

  .note {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .note.tip { background: rgba(124,154,142,0.14); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-3); }
  .note.warn { background: rgba(232,184,109,0.12); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-2); }
  .note.love { background: rgba(166,124,157,0.14); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-4); }

  .note i { font-size: 1.25rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .note.tip i { color: var(--accent-3); }
  .note.warn i { color: var(--accent-2); }
  .note.love i { color: var(--accent-4); }

  .compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .compare-col {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.2);
  }

  .compare-col h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .compare-col.ia h4 { color: var(--accent-3); }
  .compare-col.humano h4 { color: var(--accent); }

  .compare-col ul { list-style: none; }

  .compare-col li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: #e0d4c5;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .compare-col li i { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

  .rank {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(200,121,90,0.12);
  }

  .rank:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .rank .pos {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    width: 1.8rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rank .name {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #e0d4c5;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .rank .pct {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Autores */
  .authors {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .author-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(232,184,109,0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,184,109,0.3);
    color: #edc9a8;
    padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .author-badge:hover {
    background: rgba(232,184,109,0.18);
    border-color: var(--accent-2);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .author-badge i { color: var(--accent-2); font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .authors-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Fuentes */
  .source-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    counter-reset: src;
  }

  .source-list li {
    counter-increment: src;
    padding: 0.65rem 0 0.65rem 2.3rem;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(200,121,90,0.12);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #d5c9bb;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .source-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .source-list li::before {
    content: counter(src);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65rem;
    width: 1.7rem;
    height: 1.7rem;
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.18);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.35);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .source-list li strong { color: var(--accent-2); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; }

  .source-list li a {
    color: var(--accent-3);
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .source-list li a:hover { text-decoration: underline; color: var(--accent-2); }

  /* Portada */
  .cover {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 55vh;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .cover .big-ico {
    font-size: 4rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    background: rgba(232,184,109,0.10);
    border-radius: 2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
    animation: float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(232,184,109,0.35);
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50%      { transform: translateY(-12px); }
  }

  .cover h1 {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f5e9dc, #e8b86d, #c8795a);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .cover p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 620px;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,121,90,0.35);
    color: #edc9a8;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .controls {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 1rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    background: rgba(26,20,16,0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.55), 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,121,90,0.3);
    z-index: 50;
  }

  .controls button {
    background: rgba(200,121,90,0.2);
    color: var(--text);
    border: none;
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .controls button:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .controls button:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }

  .counter {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    min-width: 55px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .progress {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 4px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    z-index: 100;
  }

  .progress .bar {
    height: 100%;
    width: 0%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .center-quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 50vh;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .center-quote .big-mark {
    font-size: 4rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
  }

  .center-quote p {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ede1d3;
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .center-quote .author {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .slide { padding: 1.4rem 1.1rem; }
    .slide-title { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .cover h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
    .cover .big-ico { font-size: 2.6rem; padding: 0.7rem 1rem; }
    .compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .center-quote p { font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .stat .num { font-size: 1.9rem; }
    .author-badge { font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="progress"><div class="bar" id="bar"></div></div>

<main class="deck" id="deck">

  <!-- 1 · PORTADA -->
  <section class="slide active">
    <div class="cover">
      <div class="big-ico"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div>
      <h1>Soft Skills en la era de la IA</h1>
      <p>Por qué el mercado laboral las exige más que nunca. Datos reales, no promesas.</p>

      <div class="authors-title">Presentado por</div>
      <div class="authors">
        <span class="author-badge"><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> Bancayán Valera Kevin Roger</span>
        <span class="author-badge"><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> Marcelo Chapoñan Gerald Fernando</span>
        <span class="author-badge"><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> Valdera Soto Joel Alberto</span>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; margin-top:1.2rem;">
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart"></i> Datos 2025-2026</span>
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-briefcase"></i> Mercado laboral</span>
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-people"></i> Humanidades</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · EL DATO QUE LO CAMBIA TODO -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="slide-title"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-diamond"></i> El dato que lo cambia todo</div>

    <p>No es una opinión. Es lo que dicen los reclutadores de todo el mundo en 2026:</p>

    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num">64%</div>
        <div class="label">de reclutadores globales dice que la <strong>comunicación</strong> es la habilidad más demandada</div>
        <div class="source">GMAC, 600+ empleadores, 39 países [1]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num">14°</div>
        <div class="label">lugar: así queda "usar herramientas de IA" en el ranking de habilidades más buscadas</div>
        <div class="source">GMAC 2026 [1]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="num">39%</div>
        <div class="label">de las habilidades clave cambiarán para 2030</div>
        <div class="source">Foro Económico Mundial [2]</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quote">
      La IA no está eliminando las soft skills. Las está convirtiendo en el <strong>diferencial decisivo</strong>.
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · QUÉ DICE EL MERCADO -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="slide-title"><i class="bi bi-trophy"></i> Lo que el mercado pide (2026)</div>

    <p>Ranking de habilidades más demandadas por empleadores globales, según la encuesta de GMAC a más de 600 empresas:</p>

    <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; margin-top: 0.8rem;">
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">1</span><span class="name">Comunicación</span><span class="pct">64%</span></div>
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">2</span><span class="name">Resolución de problemas</span><span class="pct">62%</span></div>
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">3</span><span class="name">Adaptabilidad</span><span class="pct">60%</span></div>
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">4</span><span class="name">Colaboración / trabajo en equipo</span><span class="pct">—</span></div>
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">…</span><span class="name">…</span><span class="pct">—</span></div>
      <div class="rank"><span class="pos">14</span><span class="name">Uso de herramientas de IA</span><span class="pct">50%</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="note warn">
      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i>
      <span>El uso de IA queda en el puesto 14. Las habilidades humanas ocupan los primeros lugares. Pero ojo: más de la mitad de los reclutadores espera que la IA gane peso en 5 años. <strong>El futuro es híbrido: IA + humanidad</strong> [1].</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · POR QUÉ LA IA NO LAS REEMPLAZA -->
  <section class="slide">
    <div class="slide-title"><i class="bi bi-cpu"></i> Por qué la IA no puede reemplazarlas</div>

    <p>La IA procesa, genera, predice. Pero no <strong>siente, no juzga con ética, no asume responsabilidad</strong>. Expertos en empleo lo resumen así:</p>

    <ul class="list">
      <li><i class="bi bi-heart"></i> <span><strong>Empatía:</strong> interpretar el lenguaje corporal, leer entre líneas, acompañar el dolor. Una enfermera humana no se reemplaza con un robot [3].</span></li>
      <li><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> <span><strong>Juicio ético:</strong> decidir lo correcto cuando no hay reglas claras. La IA puede sugerir, pero no cargar con las consecuencias [3].</span></li>
      <li><i class="bi bi-people"></i> <span><strong>Construir confianza:</strong> relaciones de años con clientes, colegas, equipos. Eso no se transfiere a un modelo [3].</span></li>
      <li><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i> <span><strong>Pensamiento crítico:</strong> cuestionar lo que la IA genera. Detectives de errores, no repetidores de respuestas [4].</span></li>
    </ul>

